{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/528845-the-lucifuge-and-the-seventh-generation-666-or-the-bloodline-or-conspiracy","id":528845,"title":"The Lucifuge and the Seventh Generation - 666 or the Bloodline, or Conspiracy?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-05-26T09:43:37-07:00","id":528845,"title":"The Lucifuge and the Seventh Generation - 666 or the Bloodline, or Conspiracy?","content":"Question: With reference to both the earlier Hunter books and Inferno, and ignoring any God-Machine tie-in, do the members of the Lucifuge organisation number 666, or is this the total number of Seventh Generation prospects knocking about?<br /> <br /> That is to say, if we confirm an even 100 of Satan's brood knocking about in full possession (Pun!) of their powers and reveling in darkness, does this mean that there are 516 in the Lucifuge at that time?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/528-darth-fanboy","name":"Darth Fanboy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar528_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T10:12:31-07:00","id":528912,"title":"","content":"Yes, thats as far as I've understood it and/or remember it.<br /> Although the way I tend to think of it, is that the two sides are relatively balanced and/or that the Lucifuge are slightly fewer than the Children who revel in their demonic nature.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1958-krobeles","name":"Krobeles","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1958_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"499"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T10:18:34-07:00","id":528917,"title":"","content":"As fas as I understand it, the Children of the 7th Generation is the &quot;race&quot;- meaning, there are only 666 of them at any given time. The Lucifuge and the Lenfant Diabolique (from Inferno) are two big organizations which recruit those individuals- either to deny or embrace their infernal lineage.<br /> <br /> However, there is another way to look at it. From Compacts and Conspiracies, we can see that the higher is a Child's Status, the longer she should live- and with Lady Lucifuge being the head of the conspiracy, there is a good chance that she is immortal. There is no reason why that wouldn't also be true for the Lenfant, with the Chaldeans being the founders of their own organization. What it shows that there is a strong connection between a Child and an organization/ cult which is founded around her. Also, the Lady has been presented many times as the organization itself, which may have been metaphorical- but maybe it is literal..<br /> <br /> My point is this- both the Lenfant and the Lucifuge claim to have 666 potential members. Occam's Razor means that those are the same members- but perhaps the razor isn't that sharp anymore. Maybe there are 666 Children at any given time, but if one of them rises to greatness and establishing her own organization around her, she by herself spawns a lineage of 666, her own &quot;Children of 7th Generation&quot;, creating an whole organization around herself.<br /> <br /> Also, there is another option. Unlike how the Lucfiuge were presented in Hunter, Inferno gave a very different feeling about this &quot;666&quot; thing. It was presented as something more of faith and less of accurate-<br /> <br /> [Quote=Inferno]<br /> &quot;The story goes that when one dies, another of their heritage may be born, and when one is born, another must die- the whole lot of them numbers 666 if you believe their propaganda&quot;<br /> [QUOTE]<br /> <br /> If that's really the case, it may also allow that both the Lucifuge and the Lenfant have together no more then around 666, but this time it is an intentional act. It is a myth some have faith in, and others wish to preserve. They don't need to have exactly 666 members- just something close enough. Sure, it may be based around some real fact, but it could still be just a story.<br /> <br /> hope it helped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T11:16:52-07:00","id":529013,"title":"","content":"The lucifuge always number 666, period, the hunter main book and Compacts and Conspiracies are both very clear on that point.<br /> <br /> And since the moment a lucifuge dies another is chosen, there must be a whole lot of potential lucifuge to keep the number constant.<br /> <br /> Those recruited by the Enfants are not potential lucifuge, so even if the Enfants are crappy, crappy recruiters, there are a whole lot more than 666 seventh generation members, which by the way is called propaganda in Inferno. <br /> <br /> Especially since both slashers and inferno mention that some seventh generation members don't get chosen to be lucifuge or recruited by the enfants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T12:28:30-07:00","id":529124,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>StSword</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/528845-the-lucifuge-and-the-seventh-generation-666-or-the-bloodline-or-conspiracy?p=529013#post529013\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The lucifuge always number 666, period, the hunter main book and Compacts and Conspiracies are both very clear on that point.<br /> <br /> And since the moment a lucifuge dies another is chosen, there must be a whole lot of potential lucifuge to keep the number constant.<br /> <br /> Those recruited by the Enfants are not potential lucifuge, so even if the Enfants are crappy, crappy recruiters, there are a whole lot more than 666 seventh generation members, which by the way is called propaganda in Inferno.<br /> <br /> Especially since both slashers and inferno mention that some seventh generation members don't get chosen to be lucifuge or recruited by the enfants.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually think that the canon was intentionally unclear about the subject. The writing can have many interpetations. The main hunter book isn't really relevant because it was made before Inferno was even thought about, the C&amp;C wasn't very clear about the distinction between the Enfant and the Lucifuge, and what exactly the 666 means. Seriusly, I can't describe anything about the Co7G as &quot;clear&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T13:22:20-07:00","id":529185,"title":"","content":"Please, everyone knows that there only 616 Co7G.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T20:40:38-07:00","id":529564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/528845-the-lucifuge-and-the-seventh-generation-666-or-the-bloodline-or-conspiracy?p=529124#post529124\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I actually think that the canon was intentionally unclear about the subject. The writing can have many interpetations. The main hunter book isn't really relevant because it was made before Inferno was even thought about, the C&amp;C wasn't very clear about the distinction between the Enfant and the Lucifuge, and what exactly the 666 means. Seriusly, I can't describe anything about the Co7G as &quot;clear&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lucifuge number 666- Fact in Hunter main book, fact in Compacts and Conspiracies.<br /> <br /> Seventh Generation only number 666- Literally called propaganda in Inferno.<br /> <br /> I don't know about you, but I don't rank propaganda higher than fact on the truth scale.<br /> <br /> For that matter, calling Inferno a more accurate source for the Lucifuge than hunter books is rather hilarious since Inferno didn't get a single fact about the Lucifuge right-<br /> <br /> It claims that new ones are born as old ones die, but that's not true, new lucifuge are chosen immediately when a lucifuge dies, if the the new lucifuge being chosen doesn't kill an old lucifuge.<br /> <br /> It also claims that lucifuge and the enfants share powers, when in fact the lucifuge have a standardized set of abilities that are the proprietary knowledge of the lucifuge, while enfants have innate individual powers. <br /> <br /> So why take a nonhunter book over hunter books on a subject it didn't get a damn fact right? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 05-27-2015, 02:50 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-26T23:57:08-07:00","id":529647,"title":"","content":"you know that the Lucifuge were described as indistinguishable from the Co7G at Hunter's main book, right? (it is their very subtitle in the main book!) Which is the same case with the Enfant. Childern of the 7th Generation is the &quot;template&quot;. Lucifuge/Enfant are organizations. Also, do you understand that Inferno called it &quot;propaganda&quot; not from an objective point of view, but from how an outsider looks on those claims? Plus, not everything presented in the Hunter books is &quot;objectively true&quot;, even when presented as a fact. Witch Finders is a good example for that.<br /> <br /> Also, like I've said, you can read it in a way that each of the groups has 666 individuals in them- but in that case, why should the Enfant's claim be called as false and the Lucifuge's as true? Because they worship demons they must be lairs? Why can't their &quot;propaganda&quot; be also true? Why can't the Lucifuge's &quot;truth&quot; be false? What you have in the end are two groups each claims to have 666 members, and they really don't like each other- and few other individuals who have somehow escaped both groups. The only reason why the Enfant can't be called as &quot;potential Lucifuge&quot; is because it seems that somehow those who are never found by the Lucifuge ends up in their hands (as you can see in the main book).<br /> <br /> The only difference between the claims are that Inferno presents their numbers as something which may be seen as &quot;intentional&quot;, where in the Lucifuge seems to be more of &quot;natural&quot;- but doesn't it rises questions? Like, why both groups have the same number of members? And if that's the case with the Enfant, why shouldn't it be the case with the Lucifuge? If it is really an intentional act, a Lucifuge would ask himself, how can he be sure that it is not the same case in his organization? How can he know that the Lady doesn't murder her own people, or send them to suicide mission, in order to get new members which could be more &quot;important&quot; then others? Because she is nice? How much you know about her anyway?<br /> <br /> If that's not the case, then why would the demon lords would support both groups and limit their numbers to 666? How does their demonic genes work that they are mystically aware that by joining an organization they would limit the total number of the group's members, and that they are triggered by the death of another of their kin? Is it destiny? The will of Satan? How the hell that all of that works? It feels like something is manipulating them- and maybe the Lady have the answers. Also, does it mean that if you'll manage to establish you own cult around you would that mechanism start working for you- giving birth to a number of Co7G which are meant to be drawn to you? So in a way, the Lucifuge have the potential to start thousands of demon cults, each numbering 666 members? And what would happen if there are 666 cults of 666 demons all around the world? Maybe the Gates of Hell would be opened? Again, there is only one person who knows the answers, and she isn't telling.<br /> <br /> In short, the way you read the Lucifuge is harsh- which may be good for your games, but it kinda kills a lot of story ideas. Considering that this is WoD, if you think you are 100% sure of how things meant to work, you should think again. The Wicked Dead is a whole book filled with thimgs which were thought to be &quot;false&quot; and turned out to be true for Vampire, for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T17:11:18-07:00","id":530420,"title":"","content":"&quot;There are 666 agents of the lucifuge, no more, no less. One dies, another joins. One joins, another dies.&quot;<br /> <br /> Compare that to in character &quot;propaganda&quot; in a non hunter book from people who obviously don't know jack about the lucifuge, since as I pointed out they get everything about the lucifuge wrong. Or is it your contention that the writer of Inferno didn't know jack about the lucifuge? Either way, it doesn't help your argument. <br /> <br /> So on one hand we have established facts, on another we have ignorance. <br /> <br /> Inferno got lucifuge powers wrong and replenishment wrong, so why think that they know the numbers of the lucifuge better than the lucifuge and the entire hunter community?<br /> <br /> Because news flash, if Inferno was right than the Lucifuge would be a compact, groups with only a couple of hundred members don't get to play with the big boys in hunter. <br /> <br /> And no, lucifuge aren't just seventh generation members recruited by the lucifuge. Castigation is lucifuge only, when a lucifuge's power awakens, they start manifesting a castigation uncontrollably. So lucifuge are lucifuge even before the organization has found them. <br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}